  "$comment_capabilities": "Capabilities a role may declare in `tools`. Closed like every other vocabulary here: a typo such as `read-fils` would otherwise pass validation and the renderer would silently drop the capability, leaving a role that believes it can read files and cannot. Renderers map these to host tools; `escalate`, `memory-read`, `memory-write` and `task-graph` are served by this project rather than by a host tool.",
